{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國軍方今日（12日）表示，朝鮮上午向朝鮮半島東部海域發射不明飛行器，若分析證實是彈道導彈，將是朝鮮時隔9日再次發射導彈。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T02:18:54.047685+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":61,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T01:44:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:17:40.081493+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"7ad5fb17166caaa4833e72f2bfefda22d6df881634f2c597290353358cfb88e7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}